    <div>

      <p begin="00:00.000" end="00:08.000" ttm:agent="v1">**** you, *****, if you don't call me back, lose my ****in’ number</p>

      <p begin="00:14.190" end="00:15.690" ttm:agent="v1">Hol' up, ayy</p>

      <p begin="00:15.060" end="00:17.960" ttm:agent="v1">Smile, ho, take a picture with me</p>

      <p begin="00:17.960" end="00:20.970" ttm:agent="v1">I drive solo and my gas is on E</p>

      <p begin="00:20.970" end="00:23.830" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause if I get pulled over, then there’s a problem</p>

      <p begin="00:23.830" end="00:27.480" ttm:agent="v1">Baby Keem got issues and money can't solve them (Ayy)</p>

      <p begin="00:27.480" end="00:30.860" ttm:agent="v1">I got a ***** that love to do the extras</p>

      <p begin="00:30.860" end="00:34.090" ttm:agent="v1">I pull a bad ***** whenever I want (Ayy)</p>

      <p begin="00:34.090" end="00:39.350" ttm:agent="v1">I keep kickstand rock band in my trunk (Ayy)</p>

      <p begin="00:39.350" end="00:42.170" ttm:agent="v1">Baby Keem just humbled a model</p>

      <p begin="00:42.170" end="00:45.430" ttm:agent="v1">Not a fake one, a real one, don't stunt (Hol' up)</p>

      <p begin="00:45.430" end="00:48.050" ttm:agent="v1">Instagram pics, that's just a front (Hol' up)</p>

      <p begin="00:48.050" end="00:51.510" ttm:agent="v1">Lil' *****, you ain't gettin’ no gun (Tick tick)</p>

      <p begin="00:51.510" end="00:55.310" ttm:agent="v1">Flex up, why my check bought a necklace? I wrecked it</p>

      <p begin="00:55.310" end="00:58.470" ttm:agent="v1">Hoes in my backseat, ****, I guessed it (Ayy)</p>

      <p begin="00:58.470" end="01:00.730" ttm:agent="v1">** sexy target practice, bullseye</p>

      <p begin="01:00.730" end="01:03.100" ttm:agent="v1">*****, it’s just for you and I (Ayy)</p>

      <p begin="01:03.100" end="01:11.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Die for my *****, die, die, die, die, die)</p>

      <p begin="01:11.830" end="01:14.900" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, yeah, yeah, yeah, hol' up</p>

      <p begin="01:14.900" end="01:19.090" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, first thing’s first when I pop, I'ma get your ho thirsty</p>

      <p begin="01:19.090" end="01:22.300" ttm:agent="v1">I sign my paycheck in cursive, I'm worthy (Yeah)</p>

      <p begin="01:22.300" end="01:25.520" ttm:agent="v1">Hoes in the fifth always talkin' ’bout my fashion</p>

      <p begin="01:25.520" end="01:28.810" ttm:agent="v1">I tell her watch her tone, Baby Keem ain't no virgin (Yeah, yeah)</p>

      <p begin="01:28.810" end="01:32.270" ttm:agent="v1">*****, I don't have insurance to the wheels because I skrrt it (Yeah, yeah)</p>

      <p begin="01:32.270" end="01:35.240" ttm:agent="v1">I just lied to your *****, she want me to insert it (Ayy, yeah)</p>

      <p begin="01:35.240" end="01:38.310" ttm:agent="v1">My Rollie, ayy, you ain't seen light, I stole it, ayy</p>

      <p begin="01:38.310" end="01:39.850" ttm:agent="v1">Ten toes on the deck, I'm floated, ayy (Yeah)</p>

      <p begin="01:39.850" end="01:41.590" ttm:agent="v1">Scary with the clip unloaded, ayy (Yeah)</p>

      <p begin="01:41.590" end="01:45.210" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, parked on the deck, finna scoop up, lil' stupid (Whoa)</p>

      <p begin="01:45.210" end="01:48.410" ttm:agent="v1">If you ain't take the L, you's a liar, stupid (Whoa)</p>

      <p begin="01:48.410" end="01:51.730" ttm:agent="v1">I still got a ***** on the side, lil' stupid</p>

      <p begin="01:51.730" end="01:54.850" ttm:agent="v1">Just talked to my lil' Rocky yesterday, undisputed</p>

      <p begin="01:54.850" end="01:57.910" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, you got my *****? I dip it in again, I did, I did</p>

      <p begin="01:57.910" end="02:01.190" ttm:agent="v1">She gon' say my name if you hit again, I did, I did</p>

      <p begin="02:01.190" end="02:04.460" ttm:agent="v1">She can never find a new me, ain't no one equivalent (Yeah, yeah)</p>

      <p begin="02:04.460" end="02:07.720" ttm:agent="v1">And I make her want to leave him but I'm only visitin' (Ayy, yeah)</p>

      <p begin="02:07.720" end="02:12.220" ttm:agent="v1">Walk up in this *****, I'm feelin' like the black Brad Paisley (Whoa)</p>

      <p begin="02:12.220" end="02:15.440" ttm:agent="v1">Stay ten toes 'cause the opps don't faze me (Whoa)</p>

      <p begin="02:15.440" end="02:18.760" ttm:agent="v1">2019 and I'm back on your playlist (Oh my God)</p>

      <p begin="02:18.760" end="02:22.200" ttm:agent="v1">I was born to get a bag, you *****s complacent (Oh my God)</p>

      <p begin="02:22.200" end="02:25.260" ttm:agent="v1">Out with the old, I said in with the new (Ayy)</p>

      <p begin="02:25.260" end="02:28.390" ttm:agent="v1">Let me old hoes view my snaps 'cause I'm cool, ayy</p>

      <p begin="02:28.390" end="02:31.870" ttm:agent="v1">My mama did it, ayy, 'cause her son chose up, ayy (Yeah, yeah)</p>

      <p begin="02:31.870" end="02:36.640" ttm:agent="v1">Now I'm spendin' racks on a four by four truck (Yeah, yeah)</p>

      <p begin="02:36.640" end="02:38.420" ttm:agent="v1">I don't hang with emotionals</p>

